EN:
{{TAG:0003:0027:}}I wonder what you'll think of my
place when you see it, {{TAG:0005:0008:}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
{{TAG:0003:0025:}}I hope you like it.

ES:
{{TAG:0003:0027:}}No sé qué te parecerá mi casa
cuando la veas, {{TAG:0007:0000:0A000000}}{{TAG:0005:0008:}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
{{TAG:0003:0025:}}Espero que te guste.

DE:
{{TAG:0003:0027:}}Ich bin schon gespannt, wie es
dir bei mir gefällt, {{TAG:0005:0008:}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
{{TAG:0003:0025:}}Hoffentlich gut!

EN:
{{TAG:0003:0025:}}You know where I live, right?{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
If not,{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}} check your map.{{TAG:0000:0004:}}{{TAG:0003:0005:}}It's a good thing I usually keep my
house clean,{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}} huh.

ES:
{{TAG:0003:0001:}}Me encanta cómo has aceptado mi
invitación sin dudar ni un segundo.{{TAG:0007:0001:}}
{{TAG:0003:0026:}}Admiro a la gente decidida.

IT:
{{TAG:0003:0001:}}Ho adooorato il modo in cui hai
accettato subito il mio invito.{{TAG:0007:0001:}}
Vado pazza per le persone decise!

ES:
{{TAG:0003:0001:}}Esta es la primera vez que vienes
a mi casa, ¿no, {{TAG:0005:0008:}}?{{TAG:0007:0001:}}
Espero causarte buena impresión{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}.

TRANSLATION:
{{TAG:0003:0001:}}Evimi göreceğin için biraz gerildim,{{TAG:0007:0000:05000000}}
{{TAG:0005:0008:}}.{{TAG:0000:0004:}}{{TAG:0003:000B:}}İç düzenini uyumlu yapmak
için epey uğraştım,{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}} ama {{TAG:0003:000D:}}garip gelirse söyle!

EN:
{{TAG:0003:0025:}}I'm not sure if anything's changed
since the last time you were over,{{TAG:0007:0000:0A000000}}
{{TAG:0003:0005:}}so just make yourself at home.

{{TAG:0003:0010:}}Where are you going?{{TAG:0007:0000:1E000000}} Do you need
to leave town on an errand?{{TAG:0000:0004:}}{{TAG:0003:0025:}}If that's the case, {{TAG:0007:0000:0A000000}}you could come
over to my place some other time,{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}
{{TAG:0005:0007:}}.{{TAG:000F:0000:00000000}}
Let's go to your place!
OK, some other time.

DE:
{{TAG:0003:0017:}}Wo gehst du denn hin?{{TAG:0007:0000:1E000000}}
{{TAG:0003:0010:}}Willst du etwa verreisen?{{TAG:0000:0004:}}{{TAG:0003:0025:}}Das hättest du doch sagen können.{{TAG:0007:0000:0A000000}}
Du kannst mich gerne irgendwann
anders besuchen, {{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}{{TAG:0005:0007:}}.{{TAG:000F:0000:00000000}}
Nein, gehen wir zu dir!
Gut, verschieben wir's.

ES:
{{TAG:0003:0009:}}Bueno, {{TAG:0007:0000:0A000000}}¿qué se le va a hacer?{{TAG:0007:0001:}}
{{TAG:0003:0025:}}Ya quedaremos cuando tengas
un ratito libre, {{TAG:0007:0000:0A000000}}cielo.

TRANSLATION:
{{TAG:0003:0010:}}Bir dakika!{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}} {{TAG:0003:0025:}}Burası {{TAG:0011:0001:0000}}'ın evi.{{TAG:0007:0001:}}
{{TAG:0003:0015:}}Bizim BENİM evime gitmemiz
gerekiyor.{{TAG:0000:0004:}}{{TAG:0003:0001:}}Bugün evimde seninle vakit
geçirmeyi dört gözle bekliyordum,{{TAG:0007:0000:05000000}}
{{TAG:0005:0008:}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}} {{TAG:0003:0005:}}Hadi!

EN:
{{TAG:0003:0027:}}Um...{{TAG:0007:0000:1E000000}}I apologize,{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}} but I just realized
I've got an important errand to run.{{TAG:0000:0004:}}{{TAG:0003:000D:}}Can we hang out some other time?{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
I'm really sorry,{{TAG:0007:0000:05000000}} especially since I
was the one who invited you.
{{TAG:0003:0025:}}I'll be better prepared next time,{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}
{{TAG:0005:0007:}}.
